WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.917
Can't believe Ciri did this.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.125
She killed our brothers in our home.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:17.375
That thing ain't Ciri.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.750
Get anyone who's left.

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.208
Grab all the elixir you can find.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.583
We don't know what she can do.

00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:36.625
You don't want to escape.

00:00:37.792 --> 00:00:39.583
I want Ciri back.

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:42.167
The monster mash is

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.875
an epic battle between basilisks,

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:48.167
Voleth Ciri,
and everyone at Kaer Morhen.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:51.625
Yennefer told me to…

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:53.792
Shit.

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.125
It is the finale of the season.

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:57.375
It's the big bash

00:00:57.458 --> 00:01:00.000
through which we can tell
the final strands of this story.

00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:00.917
Yeah.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.625
Release her…

00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:04.917
and you can have me.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.750
That is enticing.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.500
All he really wants is to protect Ciri.

00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:10.333
And that is his one goal.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
The very person
that he's trying to protect

00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:15.292
is actually the monster
who is trying

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.583
to kill him and all of his brothers.

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:20.875
The monster mash
is basically me beating up

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.208
all the guys,

00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:23.708
which was so much fun.

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:24.833
Ciri!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.750
Geralt has to battle it out

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:38.708
with his daughter.

00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:39.625
No.

00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:47.208
It was a lot of fun.

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:49.625
I felt very powerful.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.708
It is basically
an all-hands-on-deck battle,

00:01:54.792 --> 00:01:56.500
and it's pretty epic.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.042
The other monsters
that we reveal there

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:00.125
are basilisks.

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:04.375
What the fuck
kind of basilisks are those?

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:06.542
I'll tell you after I kill 'em!

00:02:08.292 --> 00:02:11.250
I don't see how things
could get any wronger!

00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:14.500
Jaskier spends most of his time
under a table,

00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:15.625
as is right and proper.

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:19.792
I got to do a small fight with Henry.

00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:21.833
I love all the stunt stuff.

00:02:22.417 --> 00:02:24.125
We had a lot of fun.

00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:32.417
It was one of the few times
in shooting the show

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.792
where we all kind of felt like family,
so it was… Yeah, it was fun.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.000
I loved it.

